msgid "Map replay"
msgstr "Putar ulang peta"

msgid "The map is zoomed out to show its full extent. Ownership and city locations update as the turns play."
msgstr "Tampilan diperjauh agar seluruh peta terlihat. Kepemilikan wilayah dan lokasi kota diperbarui saat giliran diputar."

msgid "Start replay"
msgstr "Mulai putar ulang"

msgid "Return to game"
msgstr "Kembali ke permainan"

msgid "Turn %d of %d"
msgstr "Giliran %d dari %d"

msgid "Close replay"
msgstr "Tutup putar ulang"

msgid "Turn %d / %d"
msgstr "Giliran %d / %d"

msgid "Saved on this PC between sessions"
msgstr "Disimpan di PC ini antar sesi"

msgid "Move the table..."
msgstr "Pindahkan meja..."

msgid "Back to the middle"
msgstr "Kembali ke tengah"

msgid "Your controllers"
msgstr "Kontroler Anda"

msgid "Show button labels"
msgstr "Tampilkan label tombol"

msgid "Floating labels beside each controller saying what its buttons do right now."
msgstr "Label di samping setiap kontroler menunjukkan fungsi tombol saat ini."

msgid "The right trigger clicks when you let go of it, so holding it to zoom doesn't click anything."
msgstr "Pemicu kanan mengeklik saat dilepas, jadi menahannya untuk memperbesar tidak mengeklik apa pun."

msgid "Look"
msgstr "Tampilan"

msgid "Gameplay"
msgstr "Permainan"

msgid "Automation"
msgstr "Otomatisasi"

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Suara"

msgid "Panels"
msgstr "Panel"

msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Kontrol"

msgid "Game and saves"
msgstr "Permainan dan simpanan"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

msgid "Around the table"
msgstr "Sekitar meja"

msgid "Backgrounds and tables are folders anyone can add: see backgrounds/README.md and tables/README.md."
msgstr "Siapa pun dapat menambahkan folder latar dan meja: lihat backgrounds/README.md dan tables/README.md."

msgid "Background"
msgstr "Latar"

msgid "The world around the table: sky, light and scenery."
msgstr "Dunia di sekitar meja: langit, cahaya, dan pemandangan."

msgid "Table"
msgstr "Meja"

msgid "What the map lies on. In VR its column stretches to the height you set."
msgstr "Tempat peta diletakkan. Dalam VR, kaki meja memanjang sesuai ketinggian yang dipilih."

msgid "Where the table stands"
msgstr "Posisi meja"

msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. Remembered for this background."
msgstr "Pindahkan meja ke mana saja dalam latar, berguna untuk latar besar seperti peta hasil konversi. Posisi diingat untuk latar ini."

msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "Pindahkan meja ke mana saja dalam latar, berguna untuk latar besar. Meja telah dipindahkan ke sini; Kembali ke tengah mengembalikannya ke posisi awal."

msgid "Remembered for this background."
msgstr "Diingat untuk latar ini."

msgid "It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "Dipindahkan ke sini; Kembali ke tengah mengembalikan posisi awal."

msgid "The map"
msgstr "Peta"

msgid "Tiles"
msgstr "Ubin"

msgid "How terrain, wonders, resources and improvements look. Tilesets work like Unciv's: see tilesets/README.md."
msgstr "Tampilan medan, keajaiban, sumber daya, dan peningkatan. Set petak bekerja seperti di Unciv: lihat tilesets/README.md."

msgid "Plain coloured hexes"
msgstr "Heksagon berwarna polos"

msgid "Flat hexes in Unciv's terrain colours, no models."
msgstr "Heksagon datar dengan warna medan Unciv, tanpa model."

msgid "Units"
msgstr "Unit"

msgid "Same as the tiles"
msgstr "Sama dengan petak"

msgid "The unit models that come with the tileset above (the tiles' fallback set fills any gaps)."
msgstr "Model unit dari set petak di atas; model yang tidak tersedia memakai set cadangan."

msgid "No models"
msgstr "Tanpa model"

msgid "Round tokens with Unciv's unit icons."
msgstr "Keping bulat dengan ikon unit Unciv."

msgid "How units look (Unciv's Unitset): any tileset with unit models (pieces/Units) can supply them."
msgstr "Tampilan unit (Unitset Unciv): set petak dengan model di pieces/Units dapat menyediakannya."

msgid "Visual hints"
msgstr "Petunjuk visual"

msgid "Unciv's map overlays; the round buttons beside the overview turn them on and off too."
msgstr "Lapisan peta Unciv; tombol bulat di samping ringkasan juga dapat mengaktifkannya."

msgid "Show unit movement arrows"
msgstr "Tampilkan panah pergerakan unit"

msgid "Where units have just moved and who attacked whom."
msgstr "Gerakan terakhir unit dan siapa menyerang siapa."

msgid "Show tile yields"
msgstr "Tampilkan penghasilan ubin"

msgid "Food, production, gold... on every tile."
msgstr "Makanan, produksi, emas... di setiap petak."

msgid "Show worked tiles"
msgstr "Tampilkan ubin yang dikerjakan"

msgid "Which tiles your cities' citizens work."
msgstr "Petak yang dikerjakan penduduk kota Anda."

msgid "Show resources and improvements"
msgstr "Tampilkan sumber daya dan peningkatan"

msgid "Resource and improvement symbols on the tiles."
msgstr "Simbol sumber daya dan peningkatan pada petak."

msgid "Show improvement pictures"
msgstr "Tampilkan model peningkatan"

msgid "Farms, mines, roads and the like as models."
msgstr "Model pertanian, tambang, jalan, dan lainnya."

msgid "Show unit icons"
msgstr "Tampilkan ikon unit"

msgid "The small Unciv icon above each unit model."
msgstr "Ikon kecil Unciv di atas setiap model unit."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

msgid "Unciv's own translations, by Unciv's translators: the game's messages, names and descriptions. Our own menus are still in English."
msgstr "Terjemahan Unciv mencakup pesan, nama, dan deskripsi permainan. Menu kami masih dalam bahasa Inggris."

msgid "Text Unciv has no translation for stays in English."
msgstr "Teks yang belum diterjemahkan Unciv tetap dalam bahasa Inggris."

msgid "Turns"
msgstr "Giliran"

msgid "Check for idle units"
msgstr "Cek unit yang menganggur"

msgid "End turn first takes you to every unit that still has no orders."
msgstr "Akhiri giliran terlebih dahulu memilih setiap unit yang belum mendapat perintah."

msgid "Auto unit cycle"
msgstr "Pergantian unit otomatis"

msgid "After you give a unit its orders, the next unit waiting for orders is selected."
msgstr "Setelah memberi perintah, unit berikutnya yang menunggu perintah dipilih."

msgid "Cycle idle units by distance"
msgstr "Urutkan unit menganggur berdasarkan jarak"

msgid "Next / previous unit go to the nearest unit rather than in a fixed order."
msgstr "Unit berikut/sebelumnya memilih yang terdekat alih-alih urutan tetap."

msgid "Ask for confirmation when ending the turn"
msgstr "Minta konfirmasi sebelum mengakhiri giliran"

msgid "End turn needs a second press."
msgstr "Akhiri giliran perlu ditekan dua kali."

msgid "Order trade offers by amount"
msgstr "Susun penawaran dagang berdasarkan jumlah"

msgid "On the trade table, the biggest offers come first."
msgstr "Penawaran terbesar ditampilkan pertama di meja perdagangan."

msgid "Show suggested city locations"
msgstr "Tampilkan saran lokasi kota"

msgid "With a settler selected, Unciv's three best spots nearby for a new city are marked on the map."
msgstr "Saat pemukim dipilih, tiga lokasi kota terbaik di dekatnya menurut Unciv ditandai."

msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "Tutorial"

msgid "Show tutorials"
msgstr "Tampilkan tutorial"

msgid "The tutorial messages and the task card. Every tutorial is in the Civilopedia too."
msgstr "Pesan tutorial dan kartu tugas. Semua tutorial juga ada di Civilopedia."

msgid "Reset tutorials"
msgstr "Atur ulang tutorial"

msgid "Show every tutorial and task again, as if you were new."
msgstr "Tampilkan kembali semua tutorial dan tugas seperti pemain baru."

msgid "Other players"
msgstr "Pemain lain"

msgid "Other players' turns"
msgstr "Giliran pemain lain"

msgid "What you see of the other players' turns after you end yours."
msgstr "Yang terlihat dari giliran pemain lain setelah giliran Anda."

msgid "Show the moves and battles I can see"
msgstr "Tampilkan gerakan dan pertempuran yang terlihat"

msgid "Played back in order; the view glides to fights."
msgstr "Diputar berurutan; tampilan bergeser ke pertempuran."

msgid "Show them, fast"
msgstr "Tampilkan dengan cepat"

msgid "The same, at two and a half times the speed."
msgstr "Sama, tetapi dua setengah kali lebih cepat."

msgid "Don't show them"
msgstr "Jangan tampilkan"

msgid "The map just updates."
msgstr "Peta langsung diperbarui."

msgid "Unciv's own options for automated units and cities."
msgstr "Opsi Unciv untuk unit dan kota otomatis."

msgid "Automated and exploring units move"
msgstr "Gerakan unit otomatis dan penjelajah"

msgid "When units on automation, exploring or on multi-turn moves take their steps."
msgstr "Kapan unit otomatis, penjelajah, dan unit dengan gerakan beberapa giliran bergerak."

msgid "When I end my turn"
msgstr "Saat mengakhiri giliran saya"

msgid "Explorers, automated workers and units on long moves go as you end the turn."
msgstr "Penjelajah, pekerja otomatis, dan unit dalam perjalanan panjang bergerak saat giliran diakhiri."

msgid "At the start of my turn"
msgstr "Di awal giliran saya"

msgid "They go as your turn starts (Unciv's \"Automated units move on turn start\")."
msgstr "Mereka bergerak di awal giliran (opsi gerakan unit otomatis Unciv)."

msgid "Auto-assign city production"
msgstr "Otomatis menugaskan produksi kota"

msgid "A city that finishes building something picks what to build next itself."
msgstr "Kota memilih sendiri pembangunan berikutnya setelah selesai."

msgid "Auto-build roads"
msgstr "Otomatis bangun jalan"

msgid "Automated workers build roads between your cities."
msgstr "Pekerja otomatis membangun jalan antarkota Anda."

msgid "Automated workers replace improvements"
msgstr "Perbolehkan pekerja yang diotomatisasi mengganti peningkatan"

msgid "Automated workers may swap an improvement for a better one."
msgstr "Pekerja otomatis boleh mengganti peningkatan dengan yang lebih baik."

msgid "Stop automated workers from removing vegetation"
msgstr "Cegah pekerja otomatis menghapus vegetasi"

msgid "Automated workers leave forests, jungles and marshes alone."
msgstr "Pekerja otomatis membiarkan hutan, hutan lebat, dan rawa."

msgid "Automated units can upgrade"
msgstr "Unit yang diotomatisasi dapat meningkatkan diri"

msgid "Automated military units upgrade themselves when you can afford it."
msgstr "Unit militer otomatis meningkatkan diri saat dana cukup."

msgid "Automated units choose promotions"
msgstr "Unit yang diotomatisasi memilih promosi"

msgid "Automated units pick their own promotions."
msgstr "Unit otomatis memilih promosinya sendiri."

msgid "Cities auto-bombard at end of turn"
msgstr "Kota otomatis membombardir di akhir giliran"

msgid "Cities that can still fire shoot at enemies in range when you end the turn."
msgstr "Kota yang masih bisa menembak menyerang musuh dalam jangkauan saat giliran diakhiri."

msgid "Auto-assign specialists in new cities"
msgstr "Tetapkan spesialis otomatis di kota baru"

msgid "New cities put their citizens into specialist slots themselves."
msgstr "Kota baru menempatkan penduduk ke slot spesialis secara otomatis."

msgid "Sound effects"
msgstr "Efek suara"

msgid "Buttons, moves, battles and the rest. In VR they come from where they happen on the table."
msgstr "Tombol, gerakan, pertempuran, dan lainnya. Dalam VR, suara berasal dari lokasi kejadian di meja."

msgid "City ambience"
msgstr "Suara kota"

msgid "The city noise that loops while you are in a city - Unciv has one for every era."
msgstr "Suara berulang saat berada di kota; Unciv menyediakan suara untuk tiap era."

msgid "Your own and mods'"
msgstr "Milik Anda dan mod"

msgid "None yet."
msgstr "Belum ada."

msgid "Put the panels back"
msgstr "Atur ulang panel"

msgid "Every panel goes back to where its panel.json puts it."
msgstr "Setiap panel kembali ke posisi dalam panel.json."

msgid "In VR you see the controllers you're holding, as your headset's runtime draws them (SteamVR does; others get a plain stand-in)."
msgstr "Dalam VR, kontroler ditampilkan oleh perangkat lunak headset (SteamVR mendukungnya; yang lain memakai model sederhana)."

msgid "Boards"
msgstr "Papan"

msgid "Put the boards back"
msgstr "Atur ulang papan"

msgid "The overview, info board, big screen, city boards, empire overview and this board go back where they started."
msgstr "Ringkasan, info, layar besar, papan kota, ringkasan imperium, dan papan ini kembali ke posisi awal."

